# EARTHSONIC environment
#
# NASA GIBS, NASA POWER and NASA GISTEMP need NO credentials. They are public
# services and are queried from the server routes in app/api/*.
#
# The only optional integration is the contextual AI assistant. Any
# OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint works. Copy this file to
# .env.local and fill in your own key. Never commit .env.local.

# Required only for the Science Lab assistant:
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides:
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
